{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07458","headline":"双峰下哭故人李宥 · 刘长卿","name":"双峰下哭故人李宥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怜君孤壠寄双峰，埋骨穷泉复几重。\n白露空沾九原草，青山犹闭数株松。\n图书经乱知何在，妻子因贫失所从。\n惆怅东臯却归去，人间无处更相逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07458.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07458","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}